        "notes": "[Incendiary Blast](item_2660993e-698c-4ea0-9a65-6b1fd02f38df) is when this build really starts to come online.  Continue your combo of  [Out with a Bang](item_0c3398a1-34aa-48d0-81c1-0e4f1cf4f739) followed by the Coach Gun.  At this point you should be able to combo squishies with it pretty consistently.\n\nConsider taking [Energized Bracers](item_f83a1d9e-91f8-4d2c-bd62-c673b8d9fd2e) or  [Shady Spectacles](item_ef9bb72f-a56c-4fb6-a552-5abce0b943d7).  [Ability Lifesteal](stat_ability_lifesteal) becomes more useful now that both abilities can trigger it.\n\nAim to have 50 [Ability Power](stat_ability_power) for this round.",
