        "notes": "[Infrared Lenses](item_f19df350-745e-4e97-a495-8036b0be1262) is the second key item of this build.  It significantly increases the damage of the second half of your  [Out with a Bang](item_0c3398a1-34aa-48d0-81c1-0e4f1cf4f739) + Coach Gun combo as well as your weapon damage against burning targets.  It also increases B.O.B.'s damage against burning targets, which will become more important next round.\n\nI like to pick up [Iridescent Iris](item_b7fb28ef-ce82-416b-8693-01c274f8df4e) for its 10% [Cooldown Reduction](stat_cooldown_reduction) and 20 [Ability Power](stat_ability_power).\n\nAim to have 65-70  [Ability Power](stat_ability_power) this round.",
